{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete\nGO:0006903 vesicle targeting -> (REPLACE BY)  GO:0016192 vesicle-mediated transport\nGO:0045479 vesicle targeting to fusome\nGO:0010785 clathrin coating of Golgi vesicle, plasma membrane to endosome targeting\nGO:0048201 vesicle targeting, plasma membrane to endosome\nGO:0048199 vesicle targeting, to, from or within Golgi  -> (REPLACE BY) GO:0048193 Golgi vesicle transport\nGO:0048207 vesicle targeting, rough ER to cis-Golgi -> (REPLACE BY) GO:0006888 endoplasmic reticulum to Golgi vesicle-mediated transport\nGO:0048209 regulation of vesicle targeting, to, from or within Golgi\nGO:0048206 vesicle targeting, cis-Golgi to rough endoplasmic reticulum -> (REPLACE BY) GO:0006890 retrograde vesicle-mediated transport, Golgi to endoplasmic reticulum\nGO:0048204 vesicle targeting, inter-Golgi cisterna -> (REPLACE BY) GO:0048219 inter-Golgi cisterna vesicle-mediated transport\nGO:0048203 vesicle targeting, trans-Golgi to endosome -> (REPLACE BY)  GO:0006895 Golgi to endosome transport\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31865\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1o5T_b5I9RNLdWUgcnaHxv4lqiY88_Al3CvpC4ul3Sv8\n\nImpacted groups: \n~CAFA\t1~\n~CGD\t1~ DONE\nComplexPortal\t22\nHGNC-UCL\t5 - done\nMGI\t1\n~PINC\t3~\nRGD\t5\n~SGD\t2~ DONE\nTAIR\t2\n~UniProt\t7~\nParkinsonsUK-UCL\t1 - done\nUOS_MCB\t1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nGO:0048203\tinterpro2go\tInterPro:IPR031483 AP-1 complex-associated regulatory protein > GO:vesicle targeting, trans-Golgi to endosome ; GO:0048203\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-05-14T17:31:49Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to Review annotations to GO:0006903 vesicle targeting and descendants", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-10-12T09:39:11Z"}
